          "source_quote": "ὃν ἰδία ὑμῖν ἑκάστοτε οὐ παύσομαι ἐκτιθέμενος κεφαλαιωδῶς",
          "english_quote": "which I will not cease setting out for you separately, from time to time, in outline",
          "issue": "ἑκάστοτε means “on each occasion” or “each time.” “From time to time” weakens this to occasional repetition.",
          "suggested_revision": "Replace “from time to time” with “on each occasion”: “which I will not cease setting out for you separately, on each occasion, in outline.”",
          "severity": "minor"
        }
